            <div xml:id="d1148">

                <pb facs="1167" n="1157" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1157"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115/10–3049: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">McConaughy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-10-30">October 30,
                        1949</date>.<lb/>[Received October 30—4:51 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4600. American SS <hi rendition="#italic">Flying Cloud</hi> of Isbrandtsen
                    Company arrived Woosung October 29 at 1900 hours. Arrived Shanghai 30th at 1030
                    hours local time. Master informed Pattison, Shanghai agent, that when passing
                    into mouth Yangtze afternoon 29th, Chinese Naval LST on patrol signaled <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Cloud</hi> to stop but master ignored signal, continued
                    course and passed within 100 yards of LST which took no further action. Master
                    reported that British SS <hi rendition="#italic">Wosang</hi> was followed [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">following?</hi>] behind but turned back before passing
                    Chinese warship.</p>
                <p>British ship <hi rendition="#italic">Louise Moller</hi> sailed October 30 from
                    Shanghai.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 4600, repeated Chungking 1158, Hong Kong 350.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McConaughy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
